  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building and Nutrition for Transforming Access to WASH and Nutrition Services in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Capacity Building Agent (CBA) enhances government capacity at the central, provincial and district levels. The CBA supports multi-sectoral planning, improves budgeting, procurement and monitoring through targeted training and mentoring, as well as managing pilot interventions to test new and innovative approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
